format: 3
name: an element find returned, in a var that a tuple of accumulators carries
class: Case
method: m
arg: 4161
arg: 814161
expect: DIVERGE M5 Value/Value
jvm: Value 4161 []
uplc: Value d8799f4161ff []
note: A variable holds one type, so a tuple of accumulators encodes what find decoded. Closed by M5.
note: ADR-068 D13: on frontend=JAVAC this agrees with the JVM (Adr068SavedCasesOnJavacTest).
---
import org.julclang.core.types.JulcList;

public class Case {
    public static String m(String a, JulcList<String> xs) { var y = xs.find(q -> q.equals(a)); var z = y; long n = 0; while (n < 2) { z = y; n = n + 1; } return z; }
}
